.","en":"A monkey sees a monkey.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הדובה שותָה מים.","en":"The female bear is drinking water.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הנחש אוכל עכביש.","en":"The snake is eating a spider.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הפילה רואָה פיל.","en":"The female elephant sees an elephant.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"חיות הן לא רעות!","en":"Animals are not bad!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"תרנגול ותרנגולת.","en":"A rooster and a hen.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני לא אוכל חזיר.","en":"I do not eat pork.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסרטן אוכל אפרסק.","en":"The crab is eating a peach.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"העכביש אוכל זבוב.","en":"The spider is eating a fly.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"העכביש רואֶה מים.","en":"The spider sees water.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"יש לךָ חיית מחמד?","en":"Do you have a pet?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"לא, הכלב לא נובח.","en":"No, the dog is not barking.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/3fdadfc9bac392647d268d8dcd3f12f4"},{"he":"ארנב ונחש הם חיות.","en":"A rabbit and a snake are animals.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הארנב רואֶה ארנבת.","en":"The hare sees a female hare.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הציפור רואָה סרטן.","en":"The bird sees a crab.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"החתול גונב את החלב.","en":"The cat is stealing the milk.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אתה רוצֶה גמל או סוס?","en":"Do you want a camel or a horse?","alt":[],"t":"l"}],"hints":{"צב":"a tortoise / a turtle / turtle","גמל":"a camel / camel","חרק":"an insect / insect, bug","סוס":"a horse / horse / horse (Stallion)","פיל":"an elephant / elephant","פרה":"a cow / cow","קוף":"a monkey / monkey, ape","חתול":"a cat / cat","עכבר":"a mouse / mouse","ברווז":"a duck / duck (Drake)","דבורה":"a bee / bee","עכביש":"a spider / spider","ציפור":"a bird / bird","החיות":"at the zoo / in the zoo / the animals","תרנגול":"a rooster / rooster (Chicken)","זה":"it / it is / it's","נשר":"an eagle / eagle / vulture","אריה":"lion","בא":"come / comes / coming","חמור":"donkey","הולך":"walk, go (m.s - pres.) / walk, go","יש":"I have / do you have / has","לי":"I have / for me / me","יפֶה":"beautiful / beautiful (sg. fem.) / handsome","אוכל":"eat / eating / eats","הכלב":"the dog","נובח":"bark / barking / is barking","חתולה":"cat","רעה":"bad (f.s)","לה":"her / it (feminine nouns) / she has","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","זבוב":"fly","להם":"them / they do not have / to them","חזיר":"pig","לכם":"do you have / to you (pl. masc.) / you","צבה":"turtle, tortoise","יפָה":"beautiful / beautiful (sg. fem.) / handsome","חיה":"animal","אין":"not has / not have / nothing can be done","לנו":"for us / to us / us","זנב":"tail","או":"or","דוב":"bear","הולכת":"go / goes / is going","חיות":"animals / animal","אוכלת":"are eating / eating / is eating","רואֶה":"is seeing / see / sees","לחם":"bread","ארנב":"rabbit / hare","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","את":"it / that / the fruit","רואָה":"is seeing / see / sees","סרטן":"crab / cancer","קורא":"is reading / read / reading","ספר":"a book / book / tell! (Story)","תרנגולת":"hen (Chicken)","אתה":"you / you are / you (m.s)","ילד":"boy","שותֶה":"drink / drinking / drinks","מים":"water","תפוח":"an apple / apple","שותָה":"drink / drinking / drinks","דובה":"bear","הן":"are / they / they are","רעות":"bad (f.p)","אפרסק":"a peach / peach","לךָ":"to you / you / do you have","הם":"are / they / they are","ארנבת":"hare","החתול":"the cat","החלב":"milk / the milk / the milk is","רוצֶה":"want / wants / would like"},"words":[{"he":"שותֶה","en":"drinks","alt":["drink","drinking","is drinking"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"shoteh"},{"he":"החלב","en":"milk","alt":["the milk","the milk is"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הכלב","en":"the dog","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"צב","en":"turtle","alt":["a tortoise","a turtle"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tzav"},{"he":"נשר","en":"eagle","alt":["an eagle","vulture"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nesher"},{"he":"החתול","en":"the cat","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נובח","en":"barking","alt":["bark","is barking"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"noveakh"},{"he":"זנב","en":"Tail","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"zanav"},{"he":"סרטן","en":"Crab","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"sar'tan"},{"he":"פיל","en":"Elephant","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"pil"},{"he":"חמור","en":"Donkey","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"khamor"},{"he":"עכביש","en":"Spider","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"akavish"},{"he":"קוף","en":"Monkey, Ape","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"kof"},{"he":"פרה","en":"Cow","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"parah"},{"he":"זבוב","en":"Fly","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"z'vuv"},{"he":"חיית מחמד","en":"pet","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"khayat"},{"he":"יש","en":"have","alt":["I have","there are","has"],"from":"phrase","tr":"yesh"},{"he":"לי","en":"me","alt":["I have","to me","for me"],"from":"phrase","tr":"li"},{"he":"זה","en":"this","alt":["this is","it is"],"from":"phrase","tr":"zeh"},{"he":"את","en":"you","alt":["the milk"],"from":"phrase","tr":"at"},{"he":"לא","en":"no","alt":["is not","not"],"from":"phrase","tr":"lo"}],"lexemes":["זנב","סרטן","קופה","הפרה","פיל","הפילה","חמור","עכביש","הפיל","החמור","הקוף","העכביש","קוף","פרה","הנשר","נשר","זבוב","חיית מחמד"],"tips":"In Hebrew some animals have both masculine and feminine forms. If we use the masculine form, we are referring to a male animal, and if we use the feminine form, we are referring to a female animal.\n\nIn order to turn the masculine form of an animal into its feminine form, we often simply add \"ה\" to the end of the noun.\n\nFor example:\n\n>A male cat - חתול (khatúl)\n\n>A female cat - חתול**ה** (khatul**á**)\n\nSome animals receive the letter \"ת\" instead of \"ה\".\n\nFor example:\n\n>A male rabbit - ארנב (arnáv)\n\n>A female rabbit - ארנב**ת** (arnév**et**) (The vowels also change a bit here. You will get used to seeing this pattern as you learn new words.)\n\nNote that ציפור (bird) is **feminine**, even though it ends in ים in the plural. It is irregular:\n\nציפורים שרות - Birds are singing. tsiporím sharót"}